  "id": "physics/zerod-iter-15ma",
  "type": "fyo:ComparisonRecord",
  "comparison_kind": "verification",
  "title": "ITER 15 MA 的 0-D 功率平衡：τ_E 的定义式站不站得住",
  "recorded": "2026-09-04",
  "scenario": "docs/examples/zerod/zerod-iter-15ma",
  "compared_subject": {
    "type": "spo:Code",
    "name": "fylite",
    "comment": "本次运行产出的 fyo 文档（记录见 run 段）"
  },
  "compared_reference": [
    {
      "type": "spo:InformationContentEntity",
      "name": "物理定律与文档自身的定义",
      "comment": "判据册在 `fylite.engine.physics`：定律（正性、有限性、Grad–Shafranov）、定义（ψ 端点、V′、β_N 与 Greenwald 的式子、τ_E 的定义式）与算例声明的期望（上下界、准稳态窗口）"
    }
  ],
  "criteria": [
    {
      "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
      "quantity_label": "finite",
      "norm": "count",
      "tolerance_basis": "machine_precision",
      "tolerance": {
        "type": "spo:QuantityValue",
        "numeric_value": 0.0
      },
      "caveat": [
        "NaN / Inf 不是一个物理态，也不是「还没算」——后者应当缺席而不是写成 NaN"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
      "quantity_label": "positive-temperature",
      "norm": "(as stored)",
      "tolerance_basis": "machine_precision",
      "tolerance": {
        "type": "spo:QuantityValue",
        "numeric_value": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
      "quantity_label": "positive-density",
      "norm": "(as stored)",
      "tolerance_basis": "machine_precision",
      "tolerance": {
        "type": "spo:QuantityValue",
        "numeric_value": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
      "quantity_label": "grad-shafranov",
      "norm": "relative",
      "tolerance_basis": "reference_stated",
      "caveat": [
        "二阶中心差分，残差按 ‖Δ*ψ‖ 与 ‖RHS‖ 的均方根归一——网格越粗，截断误差越大",
        "只在边界内、离网格边一格以上的点上取",
        "ψ 每弧度、`Δ*ψ = −μ₀R²p′ − ff′`；相反符号支更小时给注记而不是判负"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
      "quantity_label": "grid-monotone",
      "norm": "count",
      "tolerance_basis": "machine_precision",
      "tolerance": {
        "type": "spo:QuantityValue",
        "numeric_value": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
      "quantity_label": "psi-endpoints",
      "norm": "relative",
      "tolerance_basis": "reference_stated"
    },
    {
      "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
      "quantity_label": "volume-monotone",
      "norm": "relative",
      "tolerance_basis": "reference_stated",
      "caveat": [
        "轴上 V′ = 0 是解析的，所以只看内部点"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
      "quantity_label": "boundary-closed",
      "norm": "relative",
      "tolerance_basis": "reference_stated",
      "caveat": [
        "闭合按采样步量而不按小半径：等值线是采出来的，首末差一个采样步之内就是闭合的",
        "越界按距离量：正落在限制器上的点是「贴着」，不是越界（射线法对这种点是随机的）",
        "没有限制器时只量闭合性，并在结论里说明"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
      "quantity_label": "pressure-consistency",
      "norm": "relative",
      "tolerance_basis": "reference_stated",
      "caveat": [
        "热压强、单一等效离子、无快离子压强；带快粒子的算例会有正的口径差",
        "两侧网格不同时按 ψ_norm 插值，缺共同横坐标就不评"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
      "quantity_label": "energy-balance",
      "norm": "relative",
      "tolerance_basis": "reference_stated",
      "caveat": [
        "P_heat 取哪几项是约定：缺省 p_ohm + p_aux + p_alpha − p_rad，可由算例声明"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
      "quantity_label": "greenwald-definition",
      "norm": "relative",
      "tolerance_basis": "reference_stated",
      "caveat": [
        "n̄_e 取体积平均；记录若用线平均会有几个百分点的口径差",
        "a 取边界外形的 (R_max − R_min)/2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
      "quantity_label": "beta-normalized-definition",
      "norm": "relative",
      "tolerance_basis": "reference_stated",
      "caveat": [
        "⟨p⟩ 是平衡压强的体积平均（热压强口径）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
      "quantity_label": "declared-bounds",
      "norm": "relative",
      "tolerance_basis": "reference_stated",
      "caveat": [
        "运行限不是定律，是这个场景的判据，所以由算例带"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "findings": [
